* BSPD_KR sensor-fault tests (schematic v06). Car idle: current sensor 2.5 V (0 A), brakes 0.6 V.
* Sensors ramp up with power (or TON later). Each scenario changes sensor values to a fault value from TF to TE; checks the shutdown circuit (sdc)
* 1 s after TF (1 = closed / car can drive, 0 = open / tripped) and how long the trip took.
* Run: ngspice -b bspd_fault_tests.cir   (trip_at = time the relay opened, in s; fault starts at 1.0 s)
.param TF=1.0 TE=3.0 TON=0
.param CUR0=2.5 BF0=0.6 BR0=0.6
.param CURF=2.5 BFF=0.6 BRF=0.6
VGLV glv 0 PWL(0 0 5m 12)
VCUR cur 0 PWL(0 0 {TON+1m} {CUR0} {TF} {CUR0} {TF+1m} {CURF} {TE} {CURF} {TE+1m} {CUR0})
VBF  bf  0 PWL(0 0 {TON+1m} {BF0} {TF} {BF0} {TF+1m} {BFF} {TE} {BFF} {TE+1m} {BF0})
VBR  br  0 PWL(0 0 {TON+1m} {BR0} {TF} {BR0} {TF+1m} {BRF} {TE} {BRF} {TE+1m} {BR0})
.include bspd_core.inc
.control
* front_unplugged: expect trip
alterparam curf=2.5
alterparam bff=0
alterparam brf=0.6
alterparam te=3.0
alterparam ton=0
reset
tran 200u 2.6 0 500u uic
meas tran sdc_before FIND v(sdc) AT=0.95
meas tran sdc_after FIND v(sdc) AT=2.0
meas tran fault_min MIN v(fault) FROM=0.5 TO=2.6
echo "RESULT front_unplugged (expect trip): sdc_closed_before=$&sdc_before sdc_closed_1s_after=$&sdc_after fault_n_min=$&fault_min"
meas tran trip_at WHEN v(sdc)=0.5 FALL=1
* rear_unplugged: expect trip
alterparam curf=2.5
alterparam bff=0.6
alterparam brf=0
alterparam te=3.0
alterparam ton=0
reset
tran 200u 2.6 0 500u uic
meas tran sdc_before FIND v(sdc) AT=0.95
meas tran sdc_after FIND v(sdc) AT=2.0
meas tran fault_min MIN v(fault) FROM=0.5 TO=2.6
echo "RESULT rear_unplugged (expect trip): sdc_closed_before=$&sdc_before sdc_closed_1s_after=$&sdc_after fault_n_min=$&fault_min"
meas tran trip_at WHEN v(sdc)=0.5 FALL=1
* current_unplugged: expect trip
alterparam curf=0
alterparam bff=0.6
alterparam brf=0.6
alterparam te=3.0
alterparam ton=0
reset
tran 200u 2.6 0 500u uic
meas tran sdc_before FIND v(sdc) AT=0.95
meas tran sdc_after FIND v(sdc) AT=2.0
meas tran fault_min MIN v(fault) FROM=0.5 TO=2.6
echo "RESULT current_unplugged (expect trip): sdc_closed_before=$&sdc_before sdc_closed_1s_after=$&sdc_after fault_n_min=$&fault_min"
meas tran trip_at WHEN v(sdc)=0.5 FALL=1
